// Stopped private-campaign capture only. All database access is read-only.
// No key environment access, signing journal/reactor construction, import,
// mutation, repair, migration, retirement, runtime or network is requested.
// The caller must independently prove that ALL source writers have stopped.
// A receipt/hash proves the observed bytes, not the provenance of an arbitrary file.
namespace fs=std::filesystem;
